<title>ISRAEL: Jordan's King Hussein lands in Israel.</title>
<headline>Jordan's King Hussein lands in Israel.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan's King Hussein arrived in Israel on Sunday to pay condolences to the families of seven schoogirls killed by a Jordanian soldier and to try to defuse tensions with Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu.</p>
<p>The king's plane landed at Tel Aviv's Ben-Gurion airport at 12:46 p.m. (1046 GMT). The landing was broadcast live on Israeli television stations.</p>
